Task F1.1: Status pane close — /measure-status toggles the pane, and Escape closes it

Why: in an inline (not fullscreen) terminal, the person could not close the
/measure-status pane with the close mark or ctrl+x x.

Changes:
- hooks/register.tsx: the measure-status command.run hook checks $.ui.panes().
  If the pane is open, it calls $.ui.close and returns
  "Closed the Measure status pane." Else it opens the pane with closeOnEscape: true.
- tests/world.ts: the test engine answers ui.close and ui.panes, and records
  the open arguments, the closed ids, and the open panes.
- tests/commands.test.ts: 2 new tests (open with closeOnEscape; close when open).
- README.md: the command table says that the command and Escape close the pane.

